# Ingest fixtures are real single-page PDFs. They are pure-ASCII byte streams,
# so git's binary sniffing classifies them as text and `git diff --check`
# then flags the xref table's spec-mandated 20-byte entries (each ends in a
# space before the EOL) as trailing whitespace. Mark them binary so git
# stores and diffs them as opaque bytes instead.
core/ingest/fixtures/*.pdf binary
